{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sohee</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven adventure following a young woman standing still in the face of unexpected reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/9b5aeafc146fda7a40bbe9ee5e568613.poster.avif?t=1774636626\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/9b5aeafc146fda7a40bbe9ee5e568613.webm?t=1774636626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/9b5aeafc146fda7a40bbe9ee5e568613.mp4?t=1774636626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sohee grew up in a single-parent household, carrying with her the belief that she was unloved. She dreamed of becoming a musical actress and set off for a new life at university, where she began dating someone she cared about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But one day, everything changed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/8c57beb8fe461274a04da221ef30278d.poster.avif?t=1774636626\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/8c57beb8fe461274a04da221ef30278d.webm?t=1774636626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/8c57beb8fe461274a04da221ef30278d.mp4?t=1774636626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crushed by the weight of life and loss, Sohee begins to retrace her steps\u2014reconnecting with her past, her feelings, and the people around her.<br>You, as the player, will follow her memories and everyday life, helping Sohee take small steps forward again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your goal is simple: help Sohee smile once more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/749ef2beeb24b9f25f9358f5f250a267.poster.avif?t=1774636626\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/749ef2beeb24b9f25f9358f5f250a267.webm?t=1774636626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/749ef2beeb24b9f25f9358f5f250a267.mp4?t=1774636626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragments of emotion hidden in everyday life</strong><br>Explore Sohee\u2019s surroundings and interact with objects as you participate in her quiet, personal journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle changes through meaningful choices</strong><br>Sohee\u2019s emotional path may shift based on the small choices you make along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive experience with minimal guidance</strong><br>There are few explanations\u2014players are encouraged to discover the meaning of each scene on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short, but emotionally rich story</strong><br>In just about an hour, experience a full spectrum of emotions\u2014love, loss, forgiveness, and personal growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/170bdf13e454fcce4a069b2b1106d216.poster.avif?t=1774636626\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/170bdf13e454fcce4a069b2b1106d216.webm?t=1774636626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/extras/170bdf13e454fcce4a069b2b1106d216.mp4?t=1774636626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please help Sohee find her happiness.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856120?t=1774636626","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/18e2767b960f7e8a6d60a04bfabdcc395818fabe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774636626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/041c9679bca21e5578534d613a17af9a50d9f112/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774636626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856120/041c9679bca21e5578534d613a17af9a50d9f112/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774636626","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4065170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sohee</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven adventure following a young woman standing still in the face of unexpected reality.</strong></p><p cla